{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3f8d21a-6c4e-4d9a-9f1b-2a7c5e8d0f31",
    "name": "PhonePe PG V2 Standard Checkout",
    "description": "PhonePe Payment Gateway - PG V2 Standard Checkout (Website / API) integration.\n\nIntroduction: Standard Checkout is the fastest way to accept payments. You create an order (Create Payment) and PhonePe returns a hosted PayPage redirectUrl where the customer completes payment using UPI, Cards, or NetBanking - PhonePe renders the entire checkout UI. You redirect the customer to that URL (or invoke it in an iframe), then confirm the outcome via Order Status and/or webhooks, and refund a completed payment with the Refund APIs.\n\nFolders:\n- Authorization -> Get Access Token\n- Payment -> Create Payment (PG_CHECKOUT)\n- Status -> Check Order Status\n- Refund -> Initiate Refund, Check Refund Status\n- Webhooks (Mock Server) -> checkout.order.completed / checkout.order.failed / pg.refund.completed / pg.refund.failed callbacks\n\nCredentials: set client_id, client_version, client_secret and tsp_env in the environment. merchantOrderId is auto-generated on every Create run by scripts, and orderId/redirectUrl are captured from responses; the access token is fetched/refreshed automatically.\n\nEnvironments:\n- Sandbox: https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox/<Endpoint>\n- Production: Authorization API https://api.phonepe.com/apis/identity-manager/<Endpoint> ; Other APIs https://api.phonepe.com/apis/pg/<Endpoint>\n\nAPI Endpoints:\n- Authorization       POST /v1/oauth/token\n- Create Payment      POST /checkout/v2/pay\n- Check Order Status  GET  /checkout/v2/order/{merchantOrderId}/status?details=true\n- Initiate Refund     POST /payments/v2/refund\n- Check Refund Status GET  /payments/v2/refund/{merchantRefundId}/status\n\nOrder states: PENDING -> COMPLETED or FAILED. Rely only on the root-level state for the payment outcome.\n\nNote: For Partner integrations, add an X-MERCHANT-ID header with the end merchant's MerchantID on every call.\n\nDocs:\n- Introduction: https://developer.phonepe.com/phonepe-payment-gateway/pg-v2-standard-checkout-integration/\n- Authorization: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/authorization/\n- Create Payment: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/create-payment/initiate-payment\n- Order Status: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/order-status\n- Refund: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/refund\n- Webhook: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/webhook\n- UAT Sandbox: https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/uat-testing-go-live/uat-sandbox",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const env = pm.environment.get('tsp_env') || 'sandbox';",
          "const isProd = env === 'production';",
          "const authUrl = isProd",
          "  ? 'https://api.phonepe.com/apis/identity-manager/v1/oauth/token'",
          "  : 'https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox/v1/oauth/token';",
          "const apiBase = isProd",
          "  ? 'https://api.phonepe.com/apis/pg'",
          "  : 'https://api-preprod.phonepe.com/apis/pg-sandbox';",
          "pm.environment.set('auth_url', authUrl);",
          "pm.environment.set('api_base_url', apiBase);",
          "",
          "const location = pm.execution.location || [];",
          "const isAuthorizationRequest = location.includes('Authorization');",
          "const isWebhook = location.includes('Webhooks (Mock Server)');",
          "if (isAuthorizationRequest || isWebhook) {",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "",
          "const token = pm.environment.get('access_token') || '';",
          "if (!token) {",
          "  throw new Error('Missing access_token. Run Authorization/Get Access Token first.');",
          "}",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Authorization', value: `O-Bearer ${token}` });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authorization",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Access Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_version", "value": "{{client_version}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{auth_url}}",
              "host": ["{{auth_url}}"]
            },
            "description": "Generate the O-Bearer access token required to authenticate all Standard Checkout API requests. Include the returned access_token in the Authorization header (O-Bearer <token>) for all subsequent calls, and refresh before expires_at. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/authorization/"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Auth success', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('access_token', data.access_token || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_type', data.token_type || 'O-Bearer');",
                  "pm.environment.set('token_expires_at', String(data.expires_at || 0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\", // auto-generated each run by pre-request script (ORDER_<timestamp>)\n  \"amount\": {{checkout_amount}}, // enter your amount here in paisa (min 100; 10000 = Rs.100)\n  \"expireAfter\": {{expire_after}}, // enter order expiry here in seconds (300-3600)\n  \"paymentFlow\": {\n    \"type\": \"PG_CHECKOUT\",\n    \"merchantUrls\": {\n      \"redirectUrl\": \"{{redirect_url}}\" // enter your post-payment redirect URL here\n    }\n  },\n  \"disablePaymentRetry\": false, // set true to prevent the customer retrying after a failed attempt\n  \"metaInfo\": {\n    \"udf1\": \"udf1\", // optional passthrough fields udf1-udf5 (returned in status/webhook)\n    \"udf2\": \"udf2\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/pay",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "pay"]
            },
            "description": "Initiate a PG Checkout session. amount is in paisa (min 100). expireAfter (seconds) is optional, range 300-3600. paymentFlow.type must be PG_CHECKOUT and paymentFlow.merchantUrls.redirectUrl is where the user is redirected after a success/failed payment. The response returns orderId, state PENDING and redirectUrl (the hosted PayPage) - redirect the user there or invoke it in an iframe. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/create-payment/initiate-payment"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-generate a unique merchant order id for each run",
                  "pm.environment.set('merchant_order_id', 'ORDER_' + Date.now());",
                  "// Auto-fill dynamic defaults only when the variable is empty (edit the body comments to override)",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('checkout_amount')) { pm.environment.set('checkout_amount', '10000'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('expire_after')) { pm.environment.set('expire_after', '1200'); }",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('redirect_url')) { pm.environment.set('redirect_url', 'https://www.google.com'); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Create Payment success', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('order_id', data.orderId || '');",
                  "pm.environment.set('checkout_redirect_url', data.redirectUrl || '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check Order Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/order/{{merchant_order_id}}/status?details=true&errorContext=true",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "order", "{{merchant_order_id}}", "status"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "details", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "errorContext", "value": "true" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the latest status of an order. details=true returns every payment attempt under paymentDetails (false returns only the latest); errorContext=true returns the errorContext block when the state is FAILED. Root-level state is PENDING, COMPLETED or FAILED - rely on it for the payment outcome. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/order-status"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status fetched', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('order_id', data.orderId || pm.environment.get('order_id'));",
                  "if (data.paymentDetails && data.paymentDetails.length) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('transaction_id', data.paymentDetails[0].transactionId || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Order Status with Settlement",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/checkout/v2/order/{{merchant_order_id}}/status?details=true&settlementDetails=true",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "v2", "order", "{{merchant_order_id}}", "status"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "details", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "settlementDetails", "value": "true" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Same as Check Order Status but with settlementDetails=true, which additionally returns a settlementDetails object: state (NOT_INITIATED / INITIATED / PROCESSED / ATTEMPT_FAILED), splitSettlementDetails[] and accountsSettlementDetails[] with amountBreakup (transactionAmount, settlementAmount, fee, sgst/cgst/igst, commission) and utr/settlementId. Populated once the order is COMPLETED and settled. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/order-status-with-settlement/"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status fetched', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.settlementDetails) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('settlement_state', data.settlementDetails.state || '');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refund",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Initiate Refund",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantRefundId\": \"{{merchant_refund_id}}\", // auto-generated each run by pre-request script (REFUND_<timestamp>)\n  \"originalMerchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\", // enter the original order id to refund here\n  \"amount\": {{refund_amount}} // enter refund amount here in paisa (min 100, must be <= captured amount)\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/payments/v2/refund",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "v2", "refund"]
            },
            "description": "Initiate a refund against a completed order. merchantRefundId is a unique refund ID (auto-generated by the pre-request script). originalMerchantOrderId is the order to refund. amount is in paisa (min 100) and must be <= the amount originally captured. The response returns refundId and state PENDING. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/refund"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('merchant_refund_id', 'REFUND_' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Refund initiated', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201, 202]);",
                  "});",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('refund_id', data.refundId || '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Check Refund Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api_base_url}}/payments/v2/refund/{{merchant_refund_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{api_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "v2", "refund", "{{merchant_refund_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Fetch the status of a refund by merchantRefundId. state is PENDING, COMPLETED or FAILED; splitInstruments describes how the amount was returned. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/refund/#nav-check-refund-status"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Refund status fetched', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks (Mock Server)",
      "description": "Sample PhonePe S2S callbacks for Standard Checkout. Right-click this folder -> Mock Collection to create a Postman mock server, then set mock_base_url to the generated URL. PhonePe signs callbacks with Authorization: SHA256(username:password) (set webhook_auth_sha256 to mirror it). Supported events: checkout.order.completed, checkout.order.failed, pg.refund.completed, pg.refund.failed. Configure the webhook URL and events in the PhonePe Business Dashboard -> Developer Settings -> Webhooks. https://developer.phonepe.com/payment-gateway/website-integration/standard-checkout/api-integration/api-reference/webhook",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Order Completed (checkout.order.completed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"OMO2403282020198641071317\",\n    \"merchantId\": \"{{merchantId_upper}}\",\n    \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\",\n    \"state\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"amount\": 10000,\n    \"expireAt\": 1724866793837,\n    \"paymentDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"paymentMode\": \"UPI_QR\",\n        \"transactionId\": \"OM12334\",\n        \"timestamp\": 1724866793837,\n        \"amount\": 10000,\n        \"state\": \"COMPLETED\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"metaInfo\": {\n      \"udf1\": \"\",\n      \"udf2\": \"\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mock_base_url}}/checkout/webhook",
              "host": ["{{mock_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "webhook"]
            },
            "description": "Sample checkout.order.completed callback, sent when an order is successfully completed. Use the root-level payload.state to confirm the payment."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Order Completed",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{mock_base_url}}/checkout/webhook",
                  "host": ["{{mock_base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["checkout", "webhook"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.completed\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"OMO2403282020198641071317\",\n    \"merchantId\": \"merchantId\",\n    \"merchantOrderId\": \"merchantOrderId\",\n    \"state\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"amount\": 10000,\n    \"expireAt\": 1724866793837,\n    \"paymentDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"paymentMode\": \"UPI_QR\",\n        \"transactionId\": \"OM12334\",\n        \"timestamp\": 1724866793837,\n        \"amount\": 10000,\n        \"state\": \"COMPLETED\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"metaInfo\": {\n      \"udf1\": \"\",\n      \"udf2\": \"\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Order Failed (checkout.order.failed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"event\": \"checkout.order.failed\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"OMO2403282020198641071311\",\n    \"merchantId\": \"{{merchantId_upper}}\",\n    \"merchantOrderId\": \"{{merchant_order_id}}\",\n    \"state\": \"FAILED\",\n    \"amount\": 10000,\n    \"expireAt\": 1724866793837,\n    \"paymentDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"paymentMode\": \"UPI_COLLECT\",\n        \"timestamp\": 1724866793837,\n        \"amount\": 10000,\n        \"transactionId\": \"OM12333\",\n        \"state\": \"FAILED\",\n        \"errorCode\": \"AUTHORIZATION_ERROR\",\n        \"detailedErrorCode\": \"ZM\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"metaInfo\": {\n      \"udf1\": \"\",\n      \"udf2\": \"\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{mock_base_url}}/checkout/webhook",
              "host": ["{{mock_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["checkout", "webhook"]
            },
            "description": "Sample checkout.order.failed callback, sent when an order fails. paymentDetails carries errorCode/detailedErrorCode for the failed attempt."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Order Failed",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "{{webhook_auth_sha256}}" }
                ],
